                <h2><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>5. Service Limitations and Disclaimers</h2>
                <h3>5.1 Service Availability</h3>
                <p>We strive to maintain 24/7 uptime, but we do not guarantee uninterrupted service. The bot may experience downtime for maintenance, updates, or due to factors beyond our control.</p>
