                <h3>5.3 Third-Party Services</h3>
                <p>Our bot integrates with third-party services (Twitch, YouTube, Kick, etc.). We are not responsible for the availability, accuracy, or functionality of these external services.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-section">
                <h2><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M18.364 18.364A9 9 0 005.636 5.636m12.728 12.728A9 9 0 015.636 5.636m12.728 12.728L5.636 5.636"/></svg>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
                <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, CertiFried MultiTool and its developers shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, loss of profits, data, use, or goodwill.</p>
